            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 7.12.1.1. If the temporary reporting center is closer to the employee's home than his/her regular reporting center, the employee will not be paid per diem or mileage. This section 7.12.1.1 does not apply to employees required to travel to their regular reporting center prior to reporting to their temporary reporting center.",
