        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 7.12.1.6. If the temporary work assignment is more than sixty (60) miles and is outside the state of Ohio, reasonable board and lodging with supervisory approval will be paid for each day of the assignment. The employee shall have the option to turn in receipts for meals or to receive $34.00 per day for each day of the assignment. No other per diem will be paid.",
